        <item>
            <title>0.6.3</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 17:25:37 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>49</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Assembly 0.6.3</h2>
<p>Picture tracks from an EDL:</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>Scene tracks from scene-first slates.</b> On slates like
    <code>15F-2A</code>, the letters after the scene number are now read as
    the setup, so a scene cut across its setups is one scene clip instead of
    dozens. Slates with a unit's letter in front (<code>V15J</code>) join the
    scene they are cut into; inserted scenes (<code>A74</code>) keep their
    own number.</li>
  <li><b>Shot colors by angle follow the setup.</b> Every take and camera of
    one setup now shares a color.</li>
  <li><b>Leaders stay off the Scene track.</b> A head or tail leader keyed
    over the neighboring reel's shots no longer shows that reel's scene. The
    Shot track is unchanged.</li>
  <li><b>Television reels.</b> A list whose leader runs up to first frame of
    action on the hour (<code>00:59:52:00</code>) is no longer offered a
    placement an hour out.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
